<title>KENYA: CRICKET-S.AFRICAN SCOREBOARD VS SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-S.AFRICAN SCOREBOARD VS SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard of the South African innings in their one-day match against Sri Lanka in the Kenyan centenary four-nation cricket tournament at the Nairobi Club on Tuesday.</p>
<p>South Africa</p>
<p>    A.Hudson c Mahanama b Vaas			   7</p>
<p>    G.Kirsten c Muralitheran b Dharmasena	   28</p>
<p>    P.Symcox c Ranatunga b S.de Silva		  9</p>
