<p>Sri Lanka: S.Jayasuriya, R.Kaluwitharana, A.Gurusinha, A.de Silva, A.Ranatunga, H.Tillekeratne, R.Mahanama, K.Dharmasena, S.de Silva, C.Vaas, M.Muralitheran.</p>
